{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1219","id":3983593616,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87tcNCQ","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1219","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1219.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1219.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1219","number":1219,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[AO-HVY-16] Project posture map to local Supabase schema","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nCloses #1201.\n\nAdds a tested Phase B local schema projection contract for the full 3,530-row 9709 posture universe. The projection is artifact-only and maps the real posture-map fields into the actual checked-in Supabase local/import surfaces:\n\n- `public.question_bank` payload fields and JSONB paths for identity, paper scope, prompt posture, display posture, rights, evidence, blockers, and source refs.\n- `public.learning_question_analysis_snapshots` payload fields for conservative diagnostic/evidence posture.\n- dry-run import receipt payload shape for local/disposable rehearsal accounting.\n\nThe generated artifacts are:\n\n- `artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-local-schema-projection-contract.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-local-schema-projection-contract.readback.md`\n- `artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-local-schema-projection-contract.validator-result.json`\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- Remote Supabase connection or mutation: no.\n- Local database mutation: no.\n- Schema, seed, migration, storage upload, or HTTP write probe: no.\n- Phase B2 mutation eligibility remains false/no-go for every row.\n- `release_scope_status` remains `non_released_fallback`; this PR makes no rights approval, final student-display, launch-readiness, or official-scoring claim.\n- Historical draft-only `source_artifact_refs` / `storage_refs` columns and missing `learning_asset_pointers` are encoded as conservative schema blockers instead of claimed current targets.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/supabase/__tests__/phase-b-local-schema-projection-contract.test.js --verbose` -> pass, 5 tests.\n- `node scripts/supabase/build-phase-b-local-schema-projection-contract.mjs --check` -> pass.\n- `npm run quality:w9:supply-chain-secret` -> pass; scan output paths printed, old #707 evidence rerun metadata not included in this PR.\n- `git diff --check` -> pass.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> exit 0, top_status `warning` only for branch-safety and expected dirty-worktree classification before commit.\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T05:35:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T05:56:03Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T05:56:03Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T05:56:03Z","merge_commit_sha":"2422423258d538962bcddb0adbb0941e2b756712","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false